%% title: Exam parts from a structure
%% desc: An exam structure holds subjects and their parts for each class number. When you pick a structure while adding an exam, only the parts of subjects that the class actually teaches are copied into the exam.
flowchart LR
  T["Exam structure"]:::admin --> G["Class 9"]:::note
  G --> S["Subject<br/>e.g. Maths"]
  S --> C["Parts<br/>Written 70, MCQ 30"]
  T -->|"pick when adding an exam"| E["Class 9 exam"]:::teacher
  C -.->|"parts of subjects the class teaches are copied"| E
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
